    text: "Affected stops:\r\nW 84th Ave & Conifer Rd (#11780) (northbound)\r\nW 84th Ave & Fox St (#11781) (northbound)\r\nHuron St & W 84th Ave (#14422) (northbound)\r\nHuron St & Milky Way (#14436) (northbound)\r\nHuron St & Milky Way (#14437) (southbound)\r\nW 84th Ave & Huron St (#11785) (southbound)\r\nW 84th Ave & Elati St (#21160) (southbound)\r\n\nFor northbound Route 8 get on/off buses at:\r\nConifer Rd & W 83rd Ave (#13157)\r\nHuron St & W 88th Ave (#14423)\r\n\nFor southbound Route 8 get on/off buses at:\r\nHuron St & W 88th Ave (#33474)\r\nConifer Rd & W 84th Ave (#13158)"
